msgctxt "64"
msgid "Man, that was easy!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "76"
msgid ""
"Here I was, wondering if anyone would really stop to help\r\n"
"some girl being harassed by a guy on the street, but we\r\n"
"nabbed one pretty fast!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "88"
msgid ""
"You moron. It was only easy because I made a great shitty\r\n"
"boyfriend. My performance was legendary."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "100"
msgid "Everything went according to plan."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "112"
msgid ""
"And not only are we getting money from that chick who\r\n"
"ordered an escort, we're gonna get even more money by\r\n"
"blackmailing that guy."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "124"
msgid "You really do think of everything!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "136"
msgid ""
"Hahaha! That's what happens when you got a good head on your shoulders! I "
"bet that right about now, that shady guy's making bank off that old fart."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "148"
msgid ""
"The dumbass honestly believed that I ran away from home\r\n"
"to see my boyfriend, then followed me all the way to that\r\n"
"hotel. What a schmuck!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "160"
msgid "It's obvious he was cruising for something else! Hah!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "172"
msgid ""
"Well, he should be havin' fun with a hottie right about now. He can't be "
"too pissed about that."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "184"
msgid "Bet he doesn't expect to be scared shitless! Hahaha!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "196"
msgid "Hahahaha!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "220"
msgid "You might wanna keep your voices down next time."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "232"
msgid "Shit! It's you...!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "244"
msgid ""
"You spent all that time thinking up this plan, but didn't\r\n"
"spend the extra second making sure it went right."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "256"
msgid ""
"What? It's not like we did anything bad to you. You're the\r\n"
"one who put yourself in that shitty situation!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "268"
msgid ""
"Is that all you have to say for taking advantage of those\r\n"
"people? Then I'll stop trying to convince you and let my\r\n"
"fists do the talking instead."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "280"
msgid ""
"Shit...! Well, whatever. I'll end this little encounter\r\n"
"by helping myself to all the cash you've got on you!"
msgstr ""

